    "title": "SelfyzAI: AI Photo Dance",
    "description": "SelfyzAI is an AI video and photo editing app that focuses on <b>photo dance</b> function. Create body animation with SelfyzAI's AI Photo Animator. With a wide variety of dance video templates and rich AI art filters, you can create short videos, cartoon avatars, images, etc; \r\n\r\nFace Dance\r\n- Take a selfie, add music, and make it dance!\r\n- Make your pets and babies sing;\r\n- Having your friends sing a song in a foreign language;\r\n- Have your leader dance to a funny song;\r\n\r\nUse the AI Baby function to predict what your future baby will look like and create templates such as yearbook; Use the photo editing function to try to remove acne and blemishes, smooth your skin, and make it look more beautiful. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc83\ud83c\udffb<b>Photo Dance</b>\r\n\u2022 Animate photos with AI animations.\r\n\u2022 Try photo dance filters and create funny videos.\r\n\u2022 Animate your pet - let your pets dance.\r\n\u2022 Unique collection of fun Templates & AI filters.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae<b>Game Filter</b>\r\n\u2022 PS2 AI game style Filter \r\n\u2022 Y2K DREAMY BLUR/HAZE EFFECT\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f<b>AI Lab</b>\r\n\u2022 Experience advanced AI Tools in AI Lab to create your own AI Anime Avatar.\r\n\u2022 Transform stunning effects of your selfies and PORTRAITS while outputting images with high quality.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7<b>AI Retake</b>\r\n\u2022 The best face app to retouch and face tune selfies.\r\n\u2022 Use hair color changer to fine the hair color that suits you best.\r\n\u2022 Solve unfocused and closed eyes, restore the natural beauty of photos.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8<b>AI Background Eraser</b>\r\n\u2022 Extract the people in photos from the original background.\r\n\u2022 Change background.\r\n\u2022 Various themes backgrounds to choose.\r\n\u2022 Smudge to remove and adjust selected parts.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude07<b>Portrait Studio</b>\r\n\u2022 Artistic photos generation in various styles.\r\n\u2022 Wedding Photos, Retro Photos & Vintage effects, Graduation photos, Festival images generation and more.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd33\ud83c\udffb<b>AI Body Editor</b>\r\n\u2022 Make adjustments to your waist, arms, face, breasts, and more for a perfect body shape in body editor.\r\n\u2022 Slimming/muscle building, get perfect curves\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc9aDownload SelfyzAI now - the professional picture editor powered by AI! It's free to download and offers an all-in-one photo experience. With make up editor, experiment with 3D Anime filter, add stickers, erase or blur backgrounds, and create beautiful photos!\r\n\r\nWe appreciate the feedback from you,that's a motivation for us\ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udffb\r\n\ud83d\udc8cEmail: selfie-ai@outlook.com",
